do_3 = "Update TestReceiptKeysServedByTheNode at rpc/sequencer_receipt_test.go:680 so a ForwardURL node with an explicitly empty local list answers its own empty list while the proposer retains nonempty pins, then exercise distinct nonempty local pins and independent committed rotation and empty-list updates; assert each node's exact own key bytes, order and inclusive ranges rather than response equality at rpc/sequencer_receipt_test.go:719, preserving signed-receipt verification and the sent-transaction coverage at rpc/sequencer_receipt_test.go:748."
do_4 = "Run the three named RPC tests in one focused package verification, including both public SDK subprocess checks inside TestPublicPxReceiptKeysCanonical; use real committed keeper state and the existing HTTP server helpers, preserve every rejection and signature check, and leave production local key discovery and receipt forwarding unchanged."
